{"notice_id":24680705,"sections":[{"kind":"SettledContract","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"CON-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-145-Contract","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2025-03-21"},{"field_id":"BT-150-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"1"},{"field_id":"BT-3202-Contract","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-0001"},{"field_id":"BT-721-Contract","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Bechtle GmbH, 44263 Dortmund"},{"field_id":"OPT-316-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0001"}]},{"kind":"SettledContract","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"CON-0002","values":[{"field_id":"BT-150-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"4600000629"},{"field_id":"BT-3202-Contract","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-0002"},{"field_id":"BT-721-Contract","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Offenes Verfahren Checkpoint Rahmenvertrag"},{"field_id":"OPT-316-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0002"}]},{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-115-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0001"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Checkpoint Rahmenvertrag"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"internalID","type":"id","value":"24- T600424012"},{"code":"supplies","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Firewall\n\nDie Firewalls kontrollieren den Datenverkehr sowohl zu internen Netzwerken als auch zu Bereichen, die aus dem Internet erreichbar sind. \n\n Checkpoint Produkte\n- Firewalls, entweder bestehend aus Software mit Lizenzen für ser-verbasierte Firewalls oder Appliances \n- Zusatzprodukte für Firewalls (\"Blades\") wie Intrusion-Detection/Intrusion-Prevention Module \n- Managementkomponenten (Appliances oder Software) zur effizien-ten Verwaltung der Firewall-Infrastruktur\n- Personaldienstleistungen (z.B. Installations-, Integrations- und Un-terstützungsleistungen). Bei Bedarf muss der Auftragnehmer in der Lage sein sicherheitsüberprüftes Personal (\"einfache Sicherheits-überprüfung\" entsprechend Sicherheitsüberwachungsgesetz NRW, Sicherheitsüberprüfungsgesetz Bund oder anderer Bundesländer) bereitzustellen.\n- Hardware-Wartung, kostenfreie Ersatzteile, kostenfreie Ersatzteil-Lieferung und kostenfreie Reparaturdienstleistungen für Einbau und Funktionstest\n- Softwarepflege / Update-Abonnement, Sicherheits-Updates zum Download, Patches für Fehlerkorrekturen, Update auf aktuelle, vom Hersteller freigegebene Softwareversionen, alles frei von Abruf- oder Lizenzkosten\n- Support, Angebot einer Service-Line für den Support der vertraglich vereinbarten Geräte.\n\n- Übernahme auslaufende Wartungs- und Pflegeverträge vorhande-ner Hardware, Software und Lizenzen aus verschiedenen/diversen  ChekPoint-User-Center Accounts von IT.NRW"},{"field_id":"BT-36-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"MONTH","value":48.0},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","i